WEBVTT

00:13:29.408 --> 00:13:32.588
but I've got a car note
and rent and insurances

00:13:32.612 --> 00:13:34.579
and insurances and insurances

00:13:34.603 --> 00:13:36.525
and credit cards and credit debt

00:13:36.549 --> 00:13:38.395
and a loan and a bad tooth

00:13:38.419 --> 00:13:40.141
and a penchant for sushi,

00:13:40.165 --> 00:13:43.152
so I drop the "jerk" but keep the truth.

00:13:44.238 --> 00:13:45.702
"Tell me," he says,

00:13:45.726 --> 00:13:48.276
"Why don't Sunnis and Shiites get along?"

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.604
"Tell me," he says,

00:13:49.628 --> 00:13:51.687
"What's going on in Iraq?"

00:13:51.711 --> 00:13:53.017
"Tell me," he says,

00:13:53.041 --> 00:13:56.671
"What's up with Saudi and Syria and Iran?"

00:13:56.695 --> 00:13:58.108
"Tell me," he says,

00:13:58.132 --> 00:14:00.734
"Why do Muslims like bombs?"